%% VeriFace AI — data, training, evaluation and research workflow (as recorded in RESEARCH.md, 2026-10-16)
flowchart TB
    classDef data fill:#F3F0FA,stroke:#6E56B5,color:#2A1E52
    classDef step fill:#EAF7EE,stroke:#2E8B57,color:#0E3B22
    classDef gate fill:#FFF4E0,stroke:#C98A1B,color:#4A3000
    classDef out fill:#E8F1FF,stroke:#2F6FD0,color:#0B2A55
